cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use NMRpaint in scientific work, please cite this software using the metadata below."
title: "NMRpaint"
type: software
version: "0.1.0"

authors:
  - family-names: "van der Ham"
    given-names: "Alexander"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0000-0000-0000"

abstract: >-
  NMRpaint is an interactive pulse-sequence design tool for creating,
  visualizing, and exporting Bruker-style NMR pulse programs. The application
  is distributed as a Python package and as a browser-based Voici application.

